sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client
    participant Handler as "Axum handler<br/>login_handler"
    participant Auth as "AuthService"
    participant UserRepo as "UserRepo port<br/>(SqliteRepo)"
    participant TokenRepo as "RefreshTokenRepo port<br/>(SqliteRepo)"
    participant DB as "SQLite"

    Note over Client,DB: The handshake — POST /api/auth/login

    Client->>Handler: POST /api/auth/login {username, password}
    Handler->>Auth: login(username, password)
    Auth->>UserRepo: find_user_by_username(username)
    UserRepo->>DB: SELECT * FROM users WHERE username = ?
    DB-->>UserRepo: row (or none)
    UserRepo-->>Auth: Option<User>

    alt user not found or argon2 verify fails
        Auth-->>Handler: Err(InvalidCredentials)
        Handler-->>Client: 401 Unauthorized
    else password verified
        Auth->>Auth: issue_access_token()<br/>(JWT, HS256, 15 min TTL)
        Auth->>Auth: generate_refresh_token()<br/>(32 random bytes, hex)
        Auth->>TokenRepo: store_refresh_token(user_id, sha256(token), expires_at)
        TokenRepo->>DB: INSERT INTO refresh_tokens ...
        Auth-->>Handler: access_token, refresh_token, user
        Handler-->>Client: 200 OK<br/>Set-Cookie: access_token (HttpOnly, 15 min)<br/>Set-Cookie: refresh_token (HttpOnly, Path=/api/auth, 14 days)
    end

    Note over Client,DB: Every subsequent request — the CurrentUser extractor

    Client->>Handler: GET /api/allocations<br/>Cookie: access_token=...
    Handler->>Handler: CurrentUser::from_request_parts()<br/>verify JWT signature + expiry
    alt token missing, expired, or invalid
        Handler-->>Client: 401 Unauthorized
        Note right of Client: frontend transparently calls<br/>POST /api/auth/refresh once,<br/>then retries the original request
    else token valid
        Handler-->>Client: 200 OK (role-appropriate response)
    end
